¶ - Installed departmental layout preserves public entrypoints and operator data.

¶ 1 — Distribution

layout:
  authoritative_kernel: all_kernel_children_including_nine_departments
  compatibility: scripts_skills_docs_grammar_templates_and_policy_paths_remain_public
  manifest: system/routing/departments.json
  hooks: existing_adapters_copied_to_scripts_as_before
  rendering: existing_placeholder_interview_and_rendering_contract
  scope: kernel_distribution_only_never_consumer_project_records

¶ 2 — Upgrade

upgrade:
  backup: every_existing_file_before_replacement
  preserve: operator_configuration_harness_hooks_personal_content_and_project_data
  replace: distribution_owned_paths_only
  validate: installed_cli_imports_hooks_selftest_and_department_dependencies
rule: no_new_installer_or_second_session_initializer
rule: warm_cold_context_and_sufficiency_are_not_configuration_fields
rule: loop_contracts_are_loaded_only_when_relevant_not_injected_per_tool
